@startuml golden-snapshot
title Golden Snapshot 生成（atecontroller ActorTemplate 状态机）
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant "Substrate Admin" as admin
participant "kube-apiserver" as kube
participant "atecontroller\nActorTemplate Reconciler" as atc
participant "ate-api-server" as api
participant "atelet / ateom\n(临时 golden worker)" as node
database "对象存储" as gcs

admin -> kube : "创建 ActorTemplate\n(image 必须 pinned，spec 不可变)"
kube -> atc : watch 事件

== Phase: Initial ==
atc -> api : "CreateAtespace(\"ate-golden\")（幂等）"
atc -> api : "CreateActor(name = AT.UID,\natespace = ate-golden)"
note right : golden actor 以模板 UID 为名，天然唯一
atc -> kube : "status.phase = ResumeGoldenActor"

== Phase: ResumeGoldenActor ==
atc -> api : ResumeActor(golden actor)
api -> node : "Run（冷启动 golden 副本）\n拉镜像 / 沙箱资产"
atc -> kube : "phase = WaitGoldenActor\nTakeGoldenSnapshotAt = now + warmup"
note right
  warmup 默认 20s；
  若所有容器声明 readyz 探针则为 0
  （ResumeActor 阻塞至探针通过）
end note

== Phase: WaitGoldenActor ==
atc -> atc : "RequeueAfter 剩余时间"
atc -> api : SuspendActor(golden actor)
api -> node : "Checkpoint(scope 强制 Full)\n上传"
node -> gcs : "golden 快照\n(内存 + rootfs 增量)"
api --> atc : "actor.LatestSnapshot = <snapshot>"
atc -> kube : "status.GoldenSnapshot = <snapshot>\nphase = Ready, Condition Ready=True"

note over atc, gcs
  此后该模板的每个新 actor 首次 Resume 默认
  从这份共享 golden 快照恢复（快速冷启动替代品）；
  golden 只读共享，actor 私有状态由 Last Snapshot 承载
end note
@enduml
